abstract: Fifteen multilingual, offline-ready interactive AI labs spanning thirteen Foundations/course-track mechanisms and two Modern AI extensions. v1.7.0 makes a stable 10–15 minute Level 1 Quick Assign available for every public lab, using local-only learner responses, canonical classroom links, EN/ZH/VI/ES presentation, and the existing mechanism-first Guided Challenge architecture while preserving all v1.6.2 algorithms and the fifteen-lab curriculum boundary.
